<title>UK: Algeria's Skikda oil port closed due bad weather.</title>
<headline>Algeria's Skikda oil port closed due bad weather.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Skikda port has been closed due to high winds and a heavy sea swell since Thursday morning, a port official said.</p>
<p>He said eight tankers for methane, crude and oil products were waiting to berth but the weather forecast for the next 24 hours was not very good.</p>
<p>A trader for Brazilian state refiner Petrobras said their 60,OOO tonnes naphtha tanker loaded on Thursday was delayed in the port.</p>
<p>--Colin Wooster, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7456</p>
